  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">(i) Status of nationally determined contributions, national mid-century strategies and NAPs communicated to the UNFCCC in 6 EaP countries; (ii) Level of institutional capacities in the six EaP countries for the implementation of the Paris Agreement; (iii) Level of alignment with EU acquis as provided by bilateral agreements with EU and in the framework of Energy Community Treaty; (iv) Level of mobilization of new climate finance resources by countries (including under NIF/NIP) since the start of the project, EUR.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2019">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">NA</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Development of sub-legal act on f-gases
2) Launch of LT-LEDS elaboration process
3) Launch of Climate Communication Strategy and Awareness Raising Action Plan
4) EU Climate Acquis Gap Analysis
5) EU Climate Acquis Strategic Roadmap 
6) Selection of priority sectors for Climate Mainstreaming
7) Procurement of TIMES Energy Modelling Tool for MOEPA
8) Technical assistance in the quality check of the updated NDC
9) Communication events organized</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Sub-legal act on f-gases was developed, validated and transferred to MOEPA by June 2020
2) Regional Environmental Center for Caucasus was contracted for elaborating LT-LEDS:
- LT-LEDS inception phase
- LT-LEDS national inception workshop
- LT-LEDS inception report 
- LT-LEDS data complication report
3) Regional Environmental Center for Caucasus was contracted for developing Climate Communication Strategy
- Diagnostic Report, Strategic Goals and Stakeholder Analysis 
- Questionnaire for national survey on climate change perception, knowledge and behavior
- National survey conducted by September 2020
- Draft report on findings of national survey
- National consultation workshop on strategic framework for Climate Communication Strategy
4) EU Climate Acquis Gap Analysis conducted and report prepared by Energy Community Secretariat
5) EU Climate Acquis Strategic Roadmap prepared by Energy Community Secretariat:
- National validation workshop organized
6) In consultation with MOEPA three sectors for climate mainstreaming were selected, specifically: Energy, Agriculture and Health:
- RFP for Climate Mainstreaming in Energy, Agriculture and Health prepared, validated and tender announced
- NGO Environment and Development was selected for climate mainstreaming assignment
7) TIMES energy modelling tool license for 5-user was procured and transferred to MOEPA
8) Technical support for the updated NDC compliance and quality check was provided through international consultant
9) Various communication and visibility events were organized and implemented in cooperation with the EUD and EU4Georgia
10) In the framework of cooperation with the Greens Movement Georgia on raising awareness and strengthening capacities of various NGOs/CSOs, various lectures and seminars were organized in regions 
11) NDC public consultation event co-organized with the MOEPA and GIZ in December 2020
12) RFP for NDC Financing Strategy and Investment Plan developed, validated and tender announced</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Finalization of LT-LEDS
2) Finalization of Climate Mainstreaming in Energy, Agriculture and Health
3) Finalization of Climate Communication Strategy and Awareness Raising Action Plan
4) Elaboration of NDC Financing Strategy and Investment Plan
5) Implementation of Climate Budget Tagging
6) Development of Conceptual Design for LULUCF MRV System
7) Provision of Support to MOESD in developing NECP
8) Implementation of Communications Action Plan 2021
9) Finalization of MRV Gap Analysis and Roadmap by EAA</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
